<title>UK: BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's EuroLeague</p>
<p>basketball matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Split: Croatia Split (Croatia) 58 Panathinaikos (Greece)</p>
<p>65 (halftime 30-36)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Split - Ante Grugurevic 13, Damir Tvrdic 12</p>
<p>Panathinaikos -  Byron Dinkins 15, Fragiskos Alvertis 13</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>In Moscow: CSKA Moscow (Russia) 70 Stefanel Milan (Italy) 55</p>
<p>(35-24)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>CSKA - Igor Kudelin 22, Valery Dayneko 22</p>
<p>Stefanel - Gregor Fucka 18</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,600</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Ljubljana: Ljubljana (Slovenia) 73 Villeurbanne (France)</p>
<p>60 (35-30)</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Berlin: Alba Berlin (Germany) 81 Teamsystem Bologna</p>
<p>(Italy) 64</p>
<p>(46-28)</p>
